Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Klang Tuned Percussion
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (filter/amp envelope templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter & amp velocity      (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> delay & reverb             (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> (no pitch bend; retargetable via override)
//  Joystick Y-> (no mod wheel; retargetable via override)
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//
//  NOTE: Klang remotable item names use underscores.
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerhead Software	se.propellerheads.Klang
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Filter	Amp
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Klang"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Klang has no drum pads; ready-to-enable templates:
// Map Pad 1		Filter_Attack
// Map Pad 2		Filter_Decay
// Map Pad 3		Filter_Sustain
// Map Pad 4		Filter_Release
// Map Pad 5		Amp_Attack
// Map Pad 6		Amp_Decay
// Map Pad 7		Amp_Sustain
// Map Pad 8		Amp_Release

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter & velocity --------
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter_Cutoff
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter_Reso
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter_Env
Map	Knob 4 A		Amp_Velocity

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): delay & reverb -----------
Map	Knob 1 B		Synced_Delay_Time
Map	Knob 2 B		Delay_Feedback
Map	Knob 3 B		Reverb_Time
Map	Knob 4 B		Reverb_PreDelay

// --- Joystick / wheels -------------------------------
// Klang exposes no pitch bend or mod wheel remotables;
// use Remote Overrides to re-point these if the device
// accepts pitch-bend input from the joystick:
//Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
//Map	Joystick Y		Filter_Env